              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ആളിക്കത്തുക — āḷikkattuka — \"to blaze up\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കാറ്റ് വീശിയപ്പോൾ തീ ആളിക്കത്തി. kāṟṟŭ vīśiyappōḷ tī āḷikkatti. When the wind blew, the fire blazed up."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: ആളിക്കത്തി, āḷikkatti."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Said of a fire that suddenly grows tall and fierce."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ആളിക്കത്തുക (āḷikkattuka) joins ആളി, \"flaring up\", and the native verb കത്തുക (kattuka), \"to burn\" (DEDR 1207). The origin of the first part is not settled."
            }
